2. `avg(view, header_column)`: This logical operator returns the average of the values under the header column (in this case, "laps_record") for the given view.
   Body: `{
             sum_values = 0;
             total_rows = count(view);
             for each row in view {
                 sum_values += row[header_column];
             }
             return sum_values / total_rows;
          }`

